9659 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 9660 0 R/Alt(Three panels showing the tracer in the square region from minus 0.5 to 0.5 in x and z, at t equal to 0, 1.5 and 3. Red is the heavy fluid on top, blue the light fluid below. At t equal to 0 the interface is almost flat, with a small wave. At t equal to 1.5 the wave has grown: two troughs of heavy fluid push down and the light fluid bulges up between them. At t equal to 3 the heavy fluid falls in two long fingers that reach z equal to minus 0.35 and spread into mushroom caps, while the light fluid rises in bubbles up to z equal to 0.25. The sides of the fingers roll up into small swirling vortices.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 21814 0 R>>
endobj
